      "cat-harness:section": "This supersedes an earlier ruling, and both are quoted on purpose",
      "prov:value": "On **2026-09-20** the owner said reviewing themes and UI *\"should be part of post MVP process in SDLC\"*, and this skill was written around that: it hung off MVP acceptance and reviewed what had shipped. **The 2026-09-24 ruling replaces it.**",
